Doug Freyburger wrote:

 > Pets avoid cursed items but it isn't complete
 > avoidance.  It seems to be similar to avoiding
 > known traps - I've lost pets who stepped under a
 > falling rock trap twice even though they usually
 > don't step on a trap a second time.

If I remember the source code correctly, the RNG
dices a direction to move out of all available
ones, but if it chooses a spot for the pet to move
that contains a cursed item, tries again. After a
small number of tries that all hit cursed items,
it just goes ahead and accepts the most recent one,
moves there, and emits the "reluctantly" warning.

